---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteForm from '../components/SiteForm.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Back the Bold | Sponsor Why Not Now?"
  description="The best brands don't just buy attention. They back movements. Partner with Why Not Now? and align your brand with courage, ambition and possibility."
>
  <section class="section section--painted">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="pill">Sponsor the podcast</p>
      <h1 class="display display--hero outlined">Back the bold</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.2rem; margin-top:1.5rem; max-width:36ch">
        <strong>The best brands don't just buy attention. They back movements.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--paper fade-in">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <p>Why Not Now? is where ambitious women come to find the courage to take the
      leap, whether that's starting a business, changing careers, rebuilding their
      lives or simply believing in themselves again.</p>
      <p>They're not just listening. They are joining the movement.</p>
      <p><strong>They're making decisions.</strong></p>

      <h2 class="display display--lg" style="margin-top:2.5rem">Why partner <span class="swash">with us?</span></h2>
      <ul class="starlist">
        <li><strong>Reach women in action.</strong> Our collective is actively investing
        in their future and in the brands they trust to be part of it.</li>
        <li><strong>Be part of the conversation.</strong> From host-read stories and
        series partnerships to live events and community experiences, your brand
        becomes woven into moments that matter.</li>
        <li><strong>Build trust, not just awareness.</strong> We only partner with
        brands we'd genuinely recommend. That's what makes our partnerships authentic
        and effective.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="display display--lg" style="margin-top:2.5rem">More than sponsorship</h2>
      <p>This isn't about advertising.</p>
      <p>It's about aligning your brand with courage, ambition and possibility.</p>
      <p>If you believe in backing women who refuse to wait...</p>
      <p><strong>Back the bold. Back Why Not Now?</strong></p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a class="btn btn--red" href="#partner-form">Request the partner deck</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--yellow fade-in" id="partner-form">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <h2 class="display display--lg" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">Request the partner deck</h2>
      <SiteForm name="sponsor" submitLabel="Request the partner deck">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="sp-name">Your name</label>
          <input id="sp-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="sp-company">Company</label>
          <input id="sp-company" name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" required />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="sp-email">Work email</label>
          <input id="sp-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="sp-message">What are you hoping to do?</label>
          <textarea id="sp-message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
        </div>
      </SiteForm>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
